demo_type: TEXT
title: "Shape Image Threshold"
target_base_style: "background: #0a0a1a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; min-height: 130px; overflow: hidden; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;"
target_inner_html: "<div class=\"float-shape\"></div>Text wraps tightly around even the faintest parts of the gradient. Almost all pixels contribute to the shape boundary."
wrapper_style: "background: #16213e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; width: 228px;"
extra_css: ".float-shape { float: left; width: 80px; height: 80px; shape-outside: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(233,69,96,1) 0%, rgba(233,69,96,0) 100%); background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(233,69,96,1) 0%, rgba(233,69,96,0) 100%); border-radius: 4px; margin-right: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.threshold-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }\n.tb-track { flex: 1; height: 6px; background: #333; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }\n.tb-fill { height: 100%; background: #e94560; border-radius: 3px; }\n.tb-value { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #e94560; min-width: 28px; text-align: right; }"
